{"title":"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all positive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96e470b7ce7a2f4d0c1ae064d2874ca377693897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, let \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d49dd65ded465f1090c6122d420d37cdc37d8b0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*} a_n =\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{lr} 11, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n\\ \\text{is\\ divisible\\ by\\ }13\\ \\text{and\\ }14;\\\\ 13, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n\\ \\text{is\\ divisible\\ by\\ }14\\ \\text{and\\ }11;\\\\ 14, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n\\ \\text{is\\ divisible\\ by\\ }11\\ \\text{and\\ }13;\\\\ 0, &amp; \\text{otherwise}. \\end{array} \\right. \\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"321\" height=\"75\" />\n</p><p>Calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/d/75db55d0047c8be209739f16eb97f02bd33f781a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{2001} a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"47\" height=\"50\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/2/c121dc6dfa61a09599de04c68f25aee25554d7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 448 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 486 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 1560 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2001 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/274a4637f71ab9e01081d83e83ddd1c7ff012e20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2002 = 11 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" />, it follows that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b990ee153a63755b7569f6eef8d2bee13f2d95.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{eqnarray*} a_n =\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{lr} 11, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n=13 \\cdot 14 \\cdot k, \\quad k = 1,2,\\cdots 10;\\\\ 13, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n=14 \\cdot 11 \\cdot k, \\quad k = 1,2,\\cdots 12;\\\\ 14, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n=11 \\cdot 13 \\cdot k, \\quad k = 1,2,\\cdots 13;\\\\ \\end{array} \\right. \\end{eqnarray*}\" width=\"369\" height=\"64\" />\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/3/013a48abdee9022ac7e279ceac12632b1ac9669f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{2001} a_n = 11 \\cdot 10 + 13 \\cdot 12 + 14 \\cdot 13 = 448 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"371\" height=\"50\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/2/292b1fe64a808a082f7a77a25866e73d22d554a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{array}{lr} 11, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n=13 \\cdot 14 \\cdot k, \\quad k = 1,2,\\cdots 10;\\\\ 13, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n=14 \\cdot 11 \\cdot k, \\quad k = 1,2,\\cdots 12;\\\\ 14, &amp; \\text{if\\ }n=11 \\cdot 13 \\cdot k, \\quad k = 1,2,\\cdots 13;\\\\ \\end{array}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"322\" height=\"62\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the LCMs of the groups of the numbers.\n</p><p>Notice that the groups are relatively prime.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/3/0c358fc6d1a08cb97f1ddb47e4d1e8362d284981.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"37\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p>11 if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of 182.\n</p><p>13 if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of 154.\n</p><p>14 if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of 143.\n</p><p>When do we see ambiguities (for example: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of 11, 13, and 14)? This is only done when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/d/4ad0d33e455347864fc322b4f0f41cd8f844e150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\operatorname{lcm}(11,13,14)=2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" />. However, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/7982db74fc657a45d2e7519cac2a26a2cead880f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;2002$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />, this can never happen.\n</p><p>So we have 10 multiples of 182 we have to count (1 to 10 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a05c3ecf5c065ff5ded5723c738c97bd308323b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*182$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />), and similarly, 12 multiples of 154, and 13 multiples of 143. The sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/e/a9e19b3d8c042e6df2f7ca0759becac1b8fcf6c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10*11+12*13+13*14=448$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"258\" height=\"15\" />. Select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6eb65962292d994ce2f9a8af63728883f256b18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"27\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B\">2002 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017033137\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 198/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4576/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.052      1 -total\n 61.01%    7.963      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 37.35%    4.875      1 Template: